// Standalone on purpose — not wrapped in Layout.astro/AppLayout. This is
// a printable/shareable version of the résumé — every role's full bullet
// list, both side projects, all leadership lines, all achievements, full
// school history. Home's "View" mode panel (.home-cv in index.astro) is
// the complete résumé too now (direct correction: "there is no such thing
// as full resume, full resume hi dikhana hai view mode mei" — View mode
// doesn't defer to this page as some fuller version, it just uses a
// Highlights line to compress the leadership list instead of listing it
// in full). This page exists as a plain, printable document for anyone
// who wants a static link or a PDF — no scale-frame, no ClientRouter,
// nothing that assumes a fixed desktop-sized canvas.
//
// Every fact below is the user's own resume text, pasted directly and
// reproduced as given — not paraphrased, not invented, not trimmed except
// where they corrected it (no "Minor in Management": "i am no longer in
// minor in magement").
